[Flexbox](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_flexible_box_layout) is a one-dimensional layout method for arranging items in rows or columns. Items _flex_ (expand) to fill additional space or shrink to fit into smaller spaces. This article explains all the fundamentals.
