But what about screen readers? They still won't see the elements as buttons. If we test our 
We can fix this using a WAI-ARIA role. Make a local copy of [`role="button"`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Reference/Roles/button_role) to each button `<div>`, for example:
