```
<svg
  version="1.1"
  baseProfile="full"
  width="300"
  height="200"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="black" />
  <circle cx="150" cy="100" r="90" fill="blue" />
</svg>

```

